modals.text:
本页完整文字
第一次生成提出调用，程序执行并返回结果。

结果进入新输入后，模型再次生成回答。
相关材料
工具调用信息
messages = [{'role': 'system', 'content': '请用中文回答。'},
 {'role': 'user', 'content': '纽约现在天气怎么样？'}]

tools = [dict(type="function", function=dict(
    name="get_weather",
    description="Get current weather for a location.",
    parameters=dict(
        type="object",
        properties=dict(location=dict(type="string")),
        required=["location"]
    )
))]

调用请求
<tool_call>
{"name": "get_weather", "arguments": {"location": "New York"}}
</tool_call><|im_end|>
解析后的字段
{
  "name": "get_weather",
  "arguments": {
    "location": "New York"
  }
}

工具返回
Current weather in New York:
Temperature: 72°F
Conditions: Partly cloudy

完整消息历史
[
  {
    "role": "system",
    "content": "请用中文回答。"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "纽约现在天气怎么样？"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "tool_calls": [
      {
        "type": "function",
        "function": {
          "name": "get_weather",
          "arguments": {
            "location": "New York"
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "role": "tool",
    "content": "Current weather in New York:\nTemperature: 72°F\nConditions: Partly cloudy"
  },
  {
    "role": "assistant",
    "content": "纽约气温72°F，局部多云。"
  }
]
